  "context": {
    "explanation_en": "« -느니만 못하다 » means it's worse than not doing ~ at all. For example, « 그렇게 할 거면 안 하느니만 못해요 » (If you're going to do it that way, it's worse than not doing it).",
    "explanation_ko": "'-느니만 못하다'는 '차라리 안 하는 게 낫다'를 의미합니다. 예: '그렇게 할 거면 안 하느니만 못해요'.",
    "key_expressions": [
      {
        "en": "If you're going to do it that way, it's worse than not doing it.",
        "ko": "그렇게 할 거면 안 하느니만 못해요."
      },
      {
        "en": "Doing it half-heartedly is worse than not doing it.",
        "ko": "대충 하느니만 못해요."
      },
      {
        "an": "x",
        "en": "A bad friend is worse than having no friend.",
        "ko": "나쁜 친구는 없느니만 못해요."
      }
    ]
  },
